  "body": "## Change\n\nAdd eight tests to the existing `egui_app::tests::pick_mode` structural suite.\nEach armed source has its own locked Contour1 shell off Geometry.\nThe existing boundary test stays. The newer Start/Exit exemption is also covered.\nPausing or disarming each new source restores the lock.\n\nThe box test sends actual pointer drags in Edge and Face modes, with Command and Shift.\nIt checks that no pick box starts, geometry stays unchanged, and Contour1 stays open.\nThe same mode and modifier still arm a box on Geometry.\n\nProduction behavior, dependencies, and snapshot PNGs do not change.\nThe decision is in `docs/decisions/1533-armed-pick-mutation-pins.md`.\n\n## Named tests and mutation results\n\nEach row removes one term, runs only the named test, then restores the source.\nEvery mutation produced one failed test at the expected assertion (exit 101).\nThe test names below have the prefix `egui_app::tests::pick_mode::`.\n\n| Removed term | Test that failed |\n| --- | --- |\n| `state.boundary_pick.is_none()` | `an_armed_boundary_row_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `state.locate_pick.is_none()` | `an_armed_locate_draft_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `state.points_pick.is_none()` | `an_armed_points_draft_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!state.wcs_ui.pick_circle` | `an_armed_wcs_circle_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!crate::wcs_pick::collecting(state)` | `a_collecting_wcs_draft_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!crate::plane_pick::collecting(state)` | `a_collecting_plane_draft_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!crate::axis_pick::collecting(state)` | `a_collecting_axis_draft_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!crate::start_exit_pick::collecting(state)` | `an_armed_start_exit_pick_unlocks_picking_off_the_geometry_tab` |\n| `!crate::interact::op_pick_locked(state)` in `box_pick::armed` | `a_modified_box_drag_is_disarmed_while_picking_is_locked` |\n\n## Checks\n\n- Original `pick_mode` baseline: 4 passed on unchanged main `034e91b8b78fa64989d18e1d5d17344531c4762c`.\n- Expanded `pick_mode`: 12 passed before mutations and 12 passed after all source was restored.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: PASS, all 10 steps, no failures or stalls.\n  It ran the UI lib and `boundary`, `boundary_picks`, `contour_dxf_sketch`, `sinker_setup`, `tap_hand`, `theme_example`, `theme_files`, `waterjet_tool`.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: PASS.\n- `git diff --check`: PASS. The final runtime-source diff is empty.\n\nLight lane: NOT RUN. This contribution is limited to debug UI checks; release-mode tests are outside its validation scope.\nNo catalog, heavy, snapshot, or full-workspace gate ran. No post or toolpath changed.\n`graphify update` did not run because `graphify` is not installed.\nNo GUI or physical-machine safety certification is claimed.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #1533\n",
